# FIX1: the credential flow end to end in the real window. Run through tools\qa\run-credential-flow.ps1 (it starts
# the local credential-checking Git test server and checks the result): push repos\cred to an http remote that asks
# for credentials -> Git calls the askpass helper -> the app shows the credential dialog (user name, then password)
# -> the typed answers reach Git -> the push goes through. Dark, 1280x720.
resize 1280x720
set theme dark
open repository cred
wait idle
shot cred-01-ahead-by-one
begin action Push
wait dialog open
shot cred-02-username
type qa-user
key enter
wait dialog open
shot cred-03-password
type qa-secret
key enter
wait dialog closed
wait idle 30000
assert no error
assert dialog closed
shot cred-04-pushed
